### Models/EntityMapper.cs

| # | Severity | Issue | Line(s) |
|---|----------|-------|---------|
| 36 | 🔴 Critical | **Uncached `GetProperties()` reflection in `MapTo<T>` and `MapFrom<T>`** — called on every mapping operation. For batch operations with thousands of records, this is extremely expensive. | 77, 114 |
| 37 | 🟡 Moderate | **`SetValue()`/`GetValue()` reflection in tight loop** — no compiled delegate or expression tree caching. | 102, 119 |
