private static readonly ConcurrentDictionary<PropertyInfo, Action<object, object?>> SetterCache = new();

private static Action<object, object?> GetSetter(PropertyInfo prop)
{
    return SetterCache.GetOrAdd(prop, p =>
    {
        var instance = Expression.Parameter(typeof(object));
        var value = Expression.Parameter(typeof(object));
        var setter = Expression.Lambda<Action<object, object?>>(
            Expression.Call(Expression.Convert(instance, p.DeclaringType!), p.SetMethod!,
                Expression.Convert(value, p.PropertyType)),
            instance, value).Compile();
        return setter;
    });
}
```

---

## Cross-Cutting Concerns

### 1. String Concatenation in Loops (7 files)
Every file that builds output uses `string +=` in loops. This is the most pervasive issue. **All should use `StringBuilder`.**

Files affected: `UnitFormatter.cs`, `TemplateEngine.cs`, `NotificationService.cs`, `LogAnalyzer.cs`, `DataPipeline.cs`, `ValidationEngine.cs`, `CsvParser.cs`

### 2. Per-Call Regex Instantiation (5 files)
`new Regex(...)` inside methods that are called repeatedly. Each instantiation parses and potentially compiles the regex pattern.

Files affected: `TemplateEngine.cs`, `SlugGenerator.cs`, `LogAnalyzer.cs`, `ValidationEngine.cs`, `CsvParser.cs`

### 3. `ContainsKey` + Indexer (6 files)
Double dictionary lookup instead of `TryGetValue`. Minor but pervasive — easy bulk fix.

Files affected: `UnitFormatter.cs`, `LogAnalyzer.cs`, `DataPipeline.cs`, `ValidationEngine.cs`, `JsonTransformer.cs`, `EntityMapper.cs`

### 4. `.ToLower()` / `.ToUpper()` Without Culture (5 files)
Risk of Turkish-I bug and unnecessary allocation. Should use `ToLowerInvariant()`, `StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase`, or `string.Equals(..., StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)`.

Files affected: `SlugGenerator.cs`, `LogAnalyzer.cs`, `DataPipeline.cs`, `CsvParser.cs`, `EntityMapper.cs`

### 5. Missing `[GeneratedRegex]` (2 files, high-value)
`MarkdownStripper` has 45+ `RegexOptions.Compiled` patterns. `SlugGenerator` has 12+ static `Regex.Replace` calls. Both are ideal candidates for .NET 8 source-generated regex.

### 6. Missing List/Dictionary Capacity Hints (8 files)
When the collection size is known or estimable, pre-sizing avoids repeated array resizing and copying.

---

## Prioritized Fix Recommendations

| Rank | Fix | File(s) | Impact | Effort |
|------|-----|---------|--------|--------|
| 1 | Replace `new HttpClient()` with `IHttpClientFactory` or static instance | `NotificationService.cs` | 🔴 Socket exhaustion prevention | Quick-fix |
| 2 | Cache regex as `static readonly` fields in `LogAnalyzer.TryParseLine` | `LogAnalyzer.cs` | 🔴 Eliminates regex per-line (~1000x faster for large logs) | Quick-fix |
| 3 | Replace `string +=` with `StringBuilder` in `CsvParser.ParseLine`/`SplitLines` | `CsvParser.cs` | 🔴 O(n²) → O(n) for CSV parsing | Quick-fix |
| 4 | Cache regex as `static readonly` in `TemplateEngine` + use `StringBuilder` in loops | `TemplateEngine.cs` | 🔴 Eliminates per-render regex + O(n²) concatenation | Quick-fix |
| 5 | Convert 45+ `Compiled` regex to `[GeneratedRegex]` in `MarkdownStripper` | `MarkdownStripper.cs` | 🟡 Eliminates JIT startup cost, same runtime perf | Moderate |
| 6 | Pre-compile regex in `SlugGenerator` (12 patterns as static fields or `[GeneratedRegex]`) | `SlugGenerator.cs` | 🟡 Eliminates regex cache lookups on every slug | Moderate |
| 7 | Add bounded parallelism (`SemaphoreSlim`) + `CancellationToken` support | `NotificationService.cs` | 🟡 Prevents resource exhaustion under load | Moderate |
| 8 | Cache `PropertyInfo[]` and compile setters/getters in `EntityMapper` | `EntityMapper.cs` | 🟡 Eliminates reflection per-call in mapping hot paths | Moderate |
| 9 | Cache regex at closure-creation time in `ValidationEngine.AddPattern` | `ValidationEngine.cs` | 🟡 Regex compiled once instead of per-validation | Quick-fix |
| 10 | Replace `string +=` with `StringBuilder` in all report-formatting methods | All services | 🟡 Reduces GC pressure in reporting paths | Quick-fix |

