### Models/EntityMapper.cs

| # | Severity | Description |
|---|----------|-------------|
| 1 | 🔴 Critical | **Uncached `GetProperties()` + `SetValue()`/`GetValue()` reflection** in `MapTo<T>` and `MapFrom<T>` (lines 77, 101, 114, 119). Called per entity in batch operations — extremely expensive in hot paths. |
| 2 | 🟡 Moderate | **`.ToLower()` without ordinal** for case-insensitive key matching (line 85). Allocates on every key comparison. Should use `StringComparer.OrdinalIgnoreCase`. |
