---

## Cross-Cutting Concerns

### 1. Per-Call Regex Instantiation (8 files)
Every file that uses regex creates instances inside methods rather than caching them as `static readonly` or using `[GeneratedRegex]`. This is the single most pervasive anti-pattern in the codebase.

### 2. String Concatenation in Loops (7 files)
`TemplateEngine`, `LogAnalyzer`, `DataPipeline`, `NotificationService`, `CsvParser`, `ValidationEngine`, and `UnitFormatter` all build strings with `+=` in loops. Replace with `StringBuilder` or `string.Join`/LINQ.

### 3. `ContainsKey` + Indexer (6 files)
`UnitFormatter`, `DataPipeline`, `LogAnalyzer`, `ValidationEngine`, `EntityMapper`, `CsvParser`, and `JsonTransformer` all perform double dictionary lookups. Use `TryGetValue` everywhere.

### 4. `.ToLower()`/`.ToUpper()` Without Invariant Culture (5 files)
`SlugGenerator`, `DataPipeline`, `LogAnalyzer`, `CsvParser`, `EntityMapper` all use `.ToLower()` — vulnerable to Turkish-I and allocates unnecessarily. Use `.ToLowerInvariant()` or `StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase`.

### 5. Unsealed Leaf Classes (4 files)
`EnglishOrdinalizer`, `GermanOrdinalizer`, `SpanishOrdinalizer`, `Record`, `PipelineResult`, `MappingConfig`, `ValidationResult` should all be `sealed` to enable JIT devirtualization.

### 6. Missing Collection Capacity Hints (6 files)
Throughout the codebase, `new List<T>()` and `new Dictionary<K,V>()` are created without capacity when the size is known or estimable.

---

## Prioritized Fix Recommendations

| Rank | Fix | Impact | Effort | Files |
|------|-----|--------|--------|-------|
| 1 | Replace `new HttpClient()` with `IHttpClientFactory` or static singleton | Eliminates socket exhaustion (production crash risk) | Moderate | `NotificationService.cs` |
| 2 | Hoist `new Regex()` in `TryParseLine` to `static readonly` / `[GeneratedRegex]` | ~1000x speedup for log parsing | Quick-fix | `LogAnalyzer.cs` |
| 3 | Replace char-by-char `string +=` with `StringBuilder` in CSV parser | O(n) vs O(n²) per line — 100x+ for large fields | Quick-fix | `CsvParser.cs` |
| 4 | Convert `SlugGenerator` regex calls to `static readonly` / `[GeneratedRegex]` | Eliminates 12 regex recompilations per slug | Quick-fix | `SlugGenerator.cs` |
| 5 | Cache `GetProperties()` and compiled setters/getters in `EntityMapper` | 50-100x speedup for reflection-heavy batch mapping | Moderate | `EntityMapper.cs` |
| 6 | Replace string `+=` in `TemplateEngine.ProcessLoops`/`RenderBatch` with `StringBuilder` | O(n) vs O(n²) for large template collections | Quick-fix | `TemplateEngine.cs` |
| 7 | Convert all 46 `MarkdownStripper` patterns to `[GeneratedRegex]` | Eliminates ~2-5s startup JIT cost, better codegen | Moderate | `MarkdownStripper.cs` |
| 8 | Cache `JsonSerializerOptions` as `static readonly` | Eliminates metadata rebuild per call | Quick-fix | `JsonTransformer.cs`, `NotificationService.cs` |
| 9 | Replace all `ContainsKey` + indexer with `TryGetValue` | 2x dictionary lookup savings (measurable at scale) | Quick-fix | 6 files |
| 10 | Pre-compile regex in `ValidationEngine.AddPattern` at rule-creation time | Eliminates recompilation per `Validate()` call | Quick-fix | `ValidationEngine.cs` |

