| 1 | 🟡 Moderate | Per-call `Regex.Replace` (static) without caching in `Render` | Line 22 |
| 2 | 🟡 Moderate | `new Regex(...)` allocated every call in `ProcessConditionals` | Line 30 |
| 3 | 🟡 Moderate | `new Regex(...)` allocated every call in `ProcessLoops` | Line 43 |
| 4 | 🔴 Critical | String `+=` in loop inside `ProcessLoops` — O(n²) with large collections | Lines 53–63 |
| 5 | 🟡 Moderate | `new Dictionary<string, object>(context)` copying entire context per iteration | Line 58 |
| 6 | 🟡 Moderate | Per-call `Regex.Replace` in `ReplaceVariables` | Line 73 |
| 7 | 🟡 Moderate | Uncached reflection `GetProperty`/`GetValue` in `ResolveValue` hot path | Line 99 |
