// #7: Cache PropertyInfo by type
private static readonly ConcurrentDictionary<(Type, string), PropertyInfo?> _propertyCache = new();

var prop = _propertyCache.GetOrAdd(
    (current.GetType(), parts[i]),
    key => key.Item1.GetProperty(key.Item2));
```

---

### TextProcessing/SlugGenerator.cs

| # | Severity | Issue | Location |
|---|----------|-------|----------|
| 1 | ℹ️ Info | `ReplacementMap` could be `FrozenDictionary` on .NET 8+ | Line 11 |
| 2 | 🟡 Moderate | `.ToLower()` without culture — Turkish-I problem | Line 30 |
| 3 | 🟡 Moderate | Sequential `.Replace()` over 9 entries — 9 intermediate strings | Lines 33–36 |
| 4 | 🔴 Critical | 12 per-call static `Regex.Replace` for diacritic normalization — runtime regex cache lookup × 12 | Lines 39–52 |
| 5 | ℹ️ Info | `List<string>` without capacity hint in `GenerateSlugs` | Line 62 |
| 6 | 🟡 Moderate | `.ToList()` + `.Contains()` O(n) lookups in `GenerateUniqueSlug` | Lines 75–81 |

**Fix recommendations:**

