### TextProcessing/MarkdownStripper.cs

| # | Severity | Issue | Location |
|---|----------|-------|----------|
| 1 | 🟡 Moderate | 46 `RegexOptions.Compiled` regex instances — excessive JIT startup cost; should use `[GeneratedRegex]` source generators on .NET 8+ | Lines 13–59 |
